   1               /RX01 (RX02) SYSTEM HANDLER
   2               /
   3               /  THIS HANDLER WAS DESIGNED TO WORK WITH RX01, RX02, RX03
   4               /
   5               /  HOWEVER, ONE SINGLE BINARY CANNOT SUCCESSFULLY BE USED IN A
   6               /  VIRGIN BUILD FOR ALL THREE DEVICES. IT IS CURRENTLY SET UP
   7               /  TO BUILD AN RX02.
   8               /  TO GENERATE A BINARY TO BUILD AN RX01, CHANGE THE RXTYP
   9               /  EQUATE TO 1. FOR AN RX03 BUILD, CHANGE RXTYP TO 3.
  10               /
  11               RXTYP=1                 /THIS IS THE SINGLE DENSITY TWO PAGE HANDLER
